/// Explicit Ask Your Team survey measures. Use visible presentation measures for results; hidden bases do not apply all reporting guards. Agreement Score describes one question, Category Score averages valid question scores equally, and Avg Score averages valid agreement questions for the selected population. Participation Completed counts full survey completions; question/option counts are not unique people across questions or surveys. With no time restriction, results use the latest nonfuture applicable reporting month; an explicit survey or month must resolve to one compatible survey. Monthly applicability carries survey results forward without creating new observations. Do not sum scores or combine surveys into time totals. Blank means unavailable or unsupported context, not measured zero. Reports control IncludeAYT eligibility; ineligible Business Units have no fact rows by the confirmed pipeline rule.
table _AYT_Measures
	lineageTag: 6f4e8611-ce40-494c-9e0d-40a634aea2a1
	sourceLineageTag: e3062480-cbed-463a-9239-07534ef68bb5

	/// HELPER: _Reporting MonthStartDate
	/// Resolves an explicit reporting month or the latest nonfuture applicable month.
	/// Returns blank for survey-only selection or unavailable month context.
	/// Use _Reporting SurveyCode to validate survey compatibility.
	measure '_Reporting MonthStartDate 2' = EXTERNALMEASURE("_Reporting MonthStartDate", DATETIME, "DirectQuery to AS - AYT_Metrics")
		formatString: dd/mm/yyyy
		isHidden
		displayFolder: _Global Helpers
		lineageTag: 6d63c3e9-a857-4fa3-8727-fe86576d606e
		sourceLineageTag: f863843c-14ee-482f-a44b-880aca00217c
		dataCategory: Uncategorized

	/// HELPER: _Reporting SurveyCode
