	/// PRESENTATION: Participation Completed
	/// Returns supplied full-completion counts for the resolved survey and report-filtered
	/// organisational scope. Full Business includes UNATTRIBUTED; detail and subsets exclude it.
	/// Use: Survey cards, organisational tables/matrices and trends with time totals disabled.
	measure 'Participation Completed' = EXTERNALMEASURE("Participation Completed", INTEGER, "DirectQuery to AS - AYT_Metrics")
