	/// PRESENTATION: Participation Invited
	/// Returns supplied invitation counts for the resolved survey and report-filtered
	/// organisational scope. Full Business includes UNATTRIBUTED; detail and subsets exclude it.
	/// Use: Survey cards, organisational tables/matrices and trends with time totals disabled.
	measure 'Participation Invited' = EXTERNALMEASURE("Participation Invited", INTEGER, "DirectQuery to AS - AYT_Metrics")
