	/// PRESENTATION: Participation Rate
	/// Returns summed full completions divided by summed invitations for the resolved
	/// survey and report-filtered organisational scope. An empty or zero denominator returns blank.
	/// Use: Survey cards, organisational tables/matrices and trends with time totals disabled.
	measure 'Participation Rate' = EXTERNALMEASURE("Participation Rate", DOUBLE, "DirectQuery to AS - AYT_Metrics")
		formatString: 0.0%;-0.0%;0.0%
